    "CoiStatement": "Wing-Kai Lam, Yi Qu and Fan Yang are employees of Li Ning (China) Sports Goods Co. Ltd. The other authors declare there are no competing interests. The authors also declare the testing shoes were built for this study based on the Invention patent (ZL 201410124508.2). The patent belongs to the institute of the first author.",
    "Article": {
      "Pagination": {"MedlinePgn": "e4086"},
      "PublicationTypeList": {"PublicationType": {
